                     <p>We not provide support for unsupported viewers, also if something happend to your account using that viewers is big chanse it will have to be recreated.</p>
                     <p class="has-text-align-center">Keep in mind other viewers may have lack of features also is possible it will be blocked in future. Using bots/AI avatars can be used only with approval of us, same as making alts avatars.</p>
