                     <p>are ownerd by Fresh Metaverse and EasierIT, you agree not to copy, transfer, or distribute any of this content or content local stores, whether in whole or in part, modified or unmodified, outside of Fresh Metaverse without approval.</p>
                     <p></p>
                     <p>Behaviour that infringes upon or violates the Intellectual Property Rights of EasierIT, other Content Providers, or any third parties including of Unauthorized sharing or distribution of Fresh Metaverse content outside of the platform will be treat as violation of terms and Furthermore, such actions may be subject to legal proceedings and penalties through the court of law.</p>
                     <p></p>
                     <p>All cases will be investigated, we may suspend your account during that procedure and if violation is proven it may result permanent ban without exception and liability. </p>
