                     <p class="has-text-align-center has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size wp-elements-65379d4d8924a0aadda23be9f9c56059"><strong>Resource Usage and Service Availability</strong></p>
                     <p></p>
                     <p>Users agree to use our services responsibly and not to engage in activities that cause excessive strain on our infrastructure, including but not limited to, excessive bandwidth consumption, CPU usage, or storage utilization, as determined by EasierIT in its sole discretion. </p>
                     <p>In the event of excessive resource usage by a user, or any other technical issue that threatens the stability, performance, or security of our services for other users, we reserve the right to take immediate action, which may include, without limitation:</p>
                     <ul class="wp-block-list">
