                              <li>Temporarily throttling or limiting access to resources.</li>
                              <li>Suspending or terminating the offending service or account, with or without prior notice.</li>
                           </ul>
                        </li>
                     </ul>
                     <p> While we strive to maintain high service availability, our services may be temporarily unavailable due to maintenance, technical issues, capacity limitations, security concerns, or other unforeseen circumstances, including those caused by excessive resource usage from any source. We shall not be liable for any damages or losses incurred by you due to such interruptions or unavailability of service. </p>
                     <p>User account involved may be suspended or terminated with or without prior notice.</p>
