                     <p></p>
                     <p class="has-text-align-left has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-dfac01c09b3dcc6728aac866aab275be"><br>Adult Avatars are not allowed in any reason including RP (except grid mom and outside avatars).</p>
                     <p class="has-text-align-left has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3d81c487042fa3ccd13adb728adfe8fa"><br>Recording videos of user session is not allowed until approval.</p>
                     <p class="has-text-align-left has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9b4faf73bc99fba02937da0e3b6276c0"><br>kid avatar cant be model in adult scenes or base of any sexual explicit and 3d acts (photo or videos).</p>
                     <p class="has-text-align-left has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-72fd3d5888b5c64cf228ed9bab46d459"></p>
                     <p class="has-text-align-left has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-74e8141e22f1030b12fcd5136fefb553">We respect your privacy but inviting people to other media especaily “Tox”, matrix.org, even discord and other may be violation of this terms.</p>
