                     <p class="has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-914a7b9e193b58316efdbf03c558e4c6"><br>Any public sex is treated as violation of this Codex </p>
                     <p class="has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e60b4ad8cc511042b615b049bb4dee0c">im-ing to people in sexual behavior, rping that way, without consent is disallowed, and is ar-able, and in consequence banable.</p>
