                     <p class="has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-028d927d8b14cf33979bb247d5d65b46">Any not PG activity involve kid avatars its AR-able and bannable after investigation without liability to appeal or refunds.</p>
                     <p class="has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a7f95d358c7d826246480e0c7211e060">Anything related to Loli 3d arts picturs or videos is not allowed in consequence may be result of instant ban..</p>
                     <p class="has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-0b5b80c736b342b1efdf830d976ed66c">=======================================================================================================================<br><strong>There is no place for anything involving rl minors in this site and grid and well nowhere is, so if You are perv that way u may leave or feel consequence.</strong></p>
                     <p class="has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-ca9bd988ba755d65c154e6dbe02fa66e">=======================================================================================================================<br>All violation of this part of codex may result instant ban. We also reserve rights to raport user data to FBI department of protecting kids agaisnt pedophile Child Abuse.</p>
                     <p class="has-text-align-center has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7041d02e1440b6a7107b5a17e0fcc331"><br><strong>Dress Code</strong> (Local Accounts)</p>
