                     <p class="has-theme-0-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-eeb54c9888fcff7d07c356a232359bc1">In local enviroment/local users Adult avatars are basicaly not allowed (Only one adult avatar on grid is Crystal Rainbow as she is Mom of all small avis. )</p>
                     <p class="has-luminous-vivid-amber-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5d4055e016a1d78001cd9a178cff58f0">Remember for hypergrid (unless partner grid) adult avatar is mandatory so please you may use any other avatar or just adjust your shape to look as adult.</p>
